      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOJANOVIC (1) was last seen getting around 400m at Geelong in a respectable 22.60 for a 1.75 lengths win. Can measure up again if runs up to latest time. SPRING QUEUE (4) was in winning form two back (22.78) at Warragul but ran below best last time at Bendigo, finishing 8th. Comes through a solid form race last start. In the mix. SMART AS ROSE (8) has been without a win for a while, the latest jumping from the squeeze draw when fourth (24.16) at Bendigo in a Grade 5. Form here is sound including five wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. One of the main contenders. PAW QATAR (6) cannot be underestimated.",
